<title>USA: Ponca City Utility, Okla., won by Capital West.</title>
<headline>Ponca City Utility, Okla., won by Capital West.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capital West Securities Inc said it won $1.750 million of Ponca City Utility Authority, Okla., utility system revenue bonds, Series 1997C, with a net interest cost of 4.98205 percent.</p>
</text>
